WEBVTT

00:03:29.873 --> 00:03:31.341
You have a son,

00:03:31.341 --> 00:03:32.509
and a daughter."

00:03:34.311 --> 00:03:35.479
With my family on board,

00:03:35.512 --> 00:03:38.315
we could start trying to make
my transition public.

00:03:38.348 --> 00:03:40.250
We worked with the school up in Orono,

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:42.786
which is where we moved
when Jonas and I were five,

00:03:42.819 --> 00:03:45.722
and we all decided
on a gradual transition.

00:03:46.456 --> 00:03:47.657
What this meant was,

00:03:47.691 --> 00:03:51.361
I wasn't going to burst into school
one day in a full dress, pearls and heels,

00:03:51.394 --> 00:03:53.196
and let everyone process that.

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:56.233
What it meant was that we were going
to spread my transition out

00:03:56.266 --> 00:03:58.168
over the course of elementary school,

00:03:58.201 --> 00:03:59.569
starting with pink,

00:03:59.603 --> 00:04:01.171
wearing my hair longer,